{"id":"c76920a4aa016144","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/306_Call-by-name_λ-演算.md","title":"306 Call-by-name λ-演算","display":"306_Call-by-name_λ-演算","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["formal-system","ZFC","repaired"],"system_id":"306","audit_status":"core_rewritten","source_sha256":"0f6969fc9e5f0cef1f12192a557645d1624aee2c169b884afd62718403fc48f7"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>formal-system</span><span>ZFC</span><span>repaired</span></div>"},{"key":"system_id","html":"306"},{"key":"audit_status","html":"core_rewritten"},{"key":"source_sha256","html":"0f6969fc9e5f0cef1f12192a557645d1624aee2c169b884afd62718403fc48f7"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"306-·-Call-by-name-λ-演算-·-严格-ZFC-核心\">306 · Call-by-name λ-演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心</h1>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"important\"><div class=\"callout-title\">验收状态</div><p>规范核心已改写；尚无整套元理论内核证明。正文的规范部分是下表指向的有限公式；说明文字不是增加元语言原语的许可证。原始代码格式已变，不能直接重用旧证明代码。逐项状态见 <a href=\"?unresolved=000_AUDIT%2F%E9%80%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%2F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5_306\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-1\" data-link-target=\"000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_306\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_306<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"1.-版本与参数\">1. 版本与参数</h2>\n<p>主求值限闭项，值为 λ；不规约实参和 λ 体。</p>\n<p>有限运行证书与无限逐步运行分开。发散要求定义域为 ω 的真实逐步运行，不允许用恒等填充伪造；卡住不自动叫发散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-规范公式入口\">2. 规范公式入口</h2>\n<p>每个名称及全部缩写依赖，都有独立 Obsidian 页面，页面 <code>zfc</code> 代码块给出完整的一阶公式。参数全部是集合变量；例如 <code>(@ FmC t)</code> 是公式缩写，不是把命题逻辑加入元语言。<code>z</code> 加数字的参数名只是生成时选取的普通变量名，无特殊语义。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c005a1be0b2ad21f\" href=\"?note=c005a1be0b2ad21f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped\">Scoped</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ddb51851d7f428a\" href=\"?note=0ddb51851d7f428a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift\">LShift</a></td>\n<td><code>c, d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0022091441242a73\" href=\"?note=0022091441242a73\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst\">LInst</a></td>\n<td><code>c, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"caf309d20e74ff8d\" href=\"?note=caf309d20e74ff8d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepCBN\">LStepCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8f3ee7c29676ec2b\" href=\"?note=8f3ee7c29676ec2b\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LReachCBN\">LReachCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f630ca741681d9ce\" href=\"?note=f630ca741681d9ce\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LEvalCBN\">LEvalCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>t, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ddd98a388acc4881\" href=\"?note=ddd98a388acc4881\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDivergesCBN\">LDivergesCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b6421ddd1ab65a55\" href=\"?note=b6421ddd1ab65a55\" title=\"000_ZFC/05_lambda\">000_ZFC/05_lambda</a>。纯语言约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">000_ZFC/01_language</a>，有限证明列的读法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d4238504f9a97862\" href=\"?note=d4238504f9a97862\" title=\"000_ZFC/02_proofs\">000_ZFC/02_proofs</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-正确性核对与未完成义务\">3. 正确性核对与未完成义务</h2>\n<p>语言闭包已由静态检查：只允许集合变量作项，非逻辑原子只有 <code>=</code> 与 <code>in</code>，全部缩写有声明、无环、无意外自由变量。此结论<strong>不等于</strong> ZFC 已证明本系统的一般可靠性、完备性、保型性或与同名标准版本的等价。</p>\n<p>定义层书面核对、算法结构下降及反例回归的适用范围见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。本篇不适用的类型检查义务不会被虚构为一个名为 Check 的空洞接口；适用的检查器与声明式推导分开定义。</p>\n<p>修复前的逐字文本保存在 <code>000_AUDIT/原稿快照/306_Call-by-name_λ-演算.md.txt</code>，只作历史证据，不参与新版缩写展开。全量未通过项见 <a href=\"?unresolved=000_AUDIT%2F03_%E5%BE%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-14\" data-link-target=\"000_AUDIT/03_待修改报告\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">000_AUDIT/03_待修改报告<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"306-·-Call-by-name-λ-演算-·-严格-ZFC-核心","text":"306 · Call-by-name λ-演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心","level":1},{"id":"1.-版本与参数","text":"1. 版本与参数","level":2},{"id":"2.-规范公式入口","text":"2. 规范公式入口","level":2},{"id":"3.-正确性核对与未完成义务","text":"3. 正确性核对与未完成义务","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_306","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"306 · Call-by-name λ-演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心","excerpt":"[!important] 验收状态\n规范核心已改写；尚无整套元理论内核证明。正文的规范部分是下表指向的有限公式；说明文字不是增加元语言原语的许可证。原始代码格式已变，不能直接重用旧证明代码。逐项状态见 [[000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_306]]。","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw","status":"resolved","id":"fad087c9d77463a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw|URaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped","status":"resolved","id":"c005a1be0b2ad21f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped|Scoped]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift","status":"resolved","id":"0ddb51851d7f428a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift|LShift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规